    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The Vel'uuish homeworld is inhabited mostly by Kir'vat, and is used as a massive store for the knowledge that they have gathered over the time that their race has existed. The Vat'iish, naturally, stay away from the homeworld as much as possible, although in times of great emergency, they willreturn home to offer their strength should it be needed, for a price.",
    "value": "基尔瓦特派主要聚居在灵猫族的母星上，将这颗星球化作浩瀚的宝库，珍藏其种族诞生以来积累的全部知识。而瓦特力士派则自然尽可能远离母星，除非遭遇重大危机，他们才会归来，他们在谈妥代价后，为故土贡献自己的力量。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The Kir'vat hope that one day the Vat'iish will see that there is strength in unity, and as such do not resent the Vat'iish for their prickly nature. Until then, they are content to exist in relative safety, knowing that despite their differences the Vat'iish are reliant on them in order to survive: who else is going to make the weapons and prepare the food rations?",
    "value": "基尔瓦特派始终期盼瓦特力士派终有一日能领悟“团结即力量”，因而并不因对方乖戾的性情而心生怨恨。眼下，他们安于相对平静的生存，深知纵有分歧，瓦特力士派仍离不开自己：若非基尔瓦特，谁来铸造兵器？谁又来调配食粮？"
